<span id="S4.T1.2.1.7.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.2.1.7.5.1.1" class="ltx_p">Outperforms BigBird on TREC DL</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.1.7.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
