<span id="S4.T1.2.1.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">GPT-4 as reranker; explicit listwise ranking via prompts</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.1.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T1.2.1.8.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:65.4pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.2.1.8.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">8k–32k tokens (via sliding windows)</span>
</span></td>
