</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T1.2.1.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:99.6pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.2.1.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Fine-tuned LLaMA for retrieval/reranking; holistic doc encoding</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.1.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
